 effortless comfort. A spacious entryway leads to a proper dining area silhouetted by a gorgeous feature wall. The bright, thoughtfully designed kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances, gorgeous granite countertops, sleek subway tile backsplash & a peninsula island with bar seating is just perfect for entertaining. The sunkissed living room is framed by large windows that open to your adorable outdoor space. The spacious primary suite easily accommodates a bed for a king & offers a large walkthrough closet leading to a 3-piece ensuite. The 2nd bedroom is ideal for guests, a home office or gym. Insuite laundry & heated underground parking add everyday convenience. Enjoy the peace & privacy of a quiet concrete building with only one neighbouring unit & the convenience of being on the ground floor. Absolutely ideal for pet owners or down sizers. Also close to a scenic trails & every amenity you could need! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$224,900"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","858 sq ft"],["Year built","2011"],["Condo fee","$499 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Windermere"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6W2J3"],["MLS® number","E4503750"],["Listed","August 14, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings"],["Heating","In Floor Heating"],["Parking","Underground, Parkade, Heated Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Common Area Maintenance, Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.78 m × 3.68 m (19'0\" × 12'1\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.12 m × 3.73 m (10'3\" × 12'3\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.00 m × 2.46 m (9'10\" × 8'1\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.24 m × 3.54 m (13'11\" × 11'7\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.25 m × 2.94 m (10'8\" × 9'8\")"]],"courtesy":"Daisy Aw, Century 21 Masters and Jennifer Pretty, Century 21 Masters","board":"REALTORS®